flowchart TD
    Trigger([User triggers AI Assistant: Ctrl+K or Drawer]) --> OpenDrawer[Open AI Assistant Slide-over Panel]
    OpenDrawer --> CheckServiceHealth{AI Service Health Check}
    
    %% Health Check Branch: AI Service Offline
    CheckServiceHealth -- Service Down / Timeout --> ShowOfflineBanner[Display Offline Banner: 'AI service unavailable']
    ShowOfflineBanner --> EnableFallbackSearch[Render Standard Keyword Search Input]
    EnableFallbackSearch --> UserEntersKeyword[User types search keyword]
    UserEntersKeyword --> ExecuteLocalSearch[Execute exact keyword search on Documents & Tasks]
    ExecuteLocalSearch --> ShowSearchResults[Display list of matching documents & tasks]
    
    %% Health Check Branch: AI Service Online
    CheckServiceHealth -- Service OK --> RenderQueryInput[Render Natural Language Query Box]
    RenderQueryInput --> SubmitQuestion[User enters question: e.g. 'Why was JWT chosen?']
    SubmitQuestion --> ShowLoadingSkeleton[Show animated thinking skeleton + Progress pulse]
    
    ShowLoadingSkeleton --> SendQueryAPI[POST /api/v1/ai/query with User JWT Session]
    SendQueryAPI --> ServerPermFilter[Server filters candidate chunks strictly by User Auth Scope]
    
    ServerPermFilter --> CheckEvidenceFound{Sufficient Evidence Found?}
    
    %% Insufficient Evidence Branch (SC-07)
    CheckEvidenceFound -- No --> RenderInsufficientCard[Render 'Insufficient Evidence' Card]
    RenderInsufficientCard --> InsufficientDetails[Show message: 'No authoritative documentation found to answer this question. Try refining keywords or check if documentation exists.']
    RenderInsufficientCard --> CTACreateDoc[Show button: 'Add Document on this topic']
    
    %% Sufficient Evidence Branch (SC-02)
    CheckEvidenceFound -- Yes --> StreamAnswer[Stream / Render Synthesized Answer]
    StreamAnswer --> AttachCitationChips[Render Interactive Citation Chips: e.g. [ADR-0001 v1.0 #p3]]
    AttachCitationChips --> RenderFeedbackButtons[Render Feedback Thumbs Up / Down]
    
    %% User Interacts with Citation Chip
    AttachCitationChips --> UserClicksCitation[User clicks Citation Chip: [ADR-0001 v1.0 #p3]]
    UserClicksCitation --> FetchPassage[Call GET /api/v1/documents/:id/versions/:ver/passages/:pId]
    FetchPassage --> CheckPassageAuth{Re-validate current permission?}
    
    CheckPassageAuth -- Denied (Grant revoked mid-session) --> CitationRevoked[Show modal: '404 - Source unavailable']
    CheckPassageAuth -- Permitted --> OpenPassageModal[Open Source Inspector Split View]
    OpenPassageModal --> HighlightText[Display Document exact version and highlight matched passage]
    OpenPassageModal --> ShowVersionStatus[Show badge: 'CURRENT' or 'SUPERSEDED']
